{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_ttr_74_1","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_74","textTraditional":"【經】","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_ttr_74_2","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_74","textTraditional":"十有一年春。晉殺其大夫丕鄭父。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_ttr_74_3","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_74","textTraditional":"夏，公及夫人姜氏會齊侯于陽穀。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_ttr_74_4","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_74","textTraditional":"秋八月，大雩。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_ttr_74_5","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_74","textTraditional":"冬，楚人伐黃。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_ttr_74_6","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_74","textTraditional":"【傳】","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_ttr_74_7","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_74","textTraditional":"十一年春，晉侯使以丕鄭之亂來告。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_ttr_74_8","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_74","textTraditional":"天王使召武公、內史過賜晉侯命。受玉惰。過歸，告王曰：「晉侯其無後乎！王賜之命，而惰於受瑞，先自棄也已，其何繼之有？禮，國之幹也；敬，禮之輿也。不敬，則禮不行；禮不行，則上下昏，何以長世？」","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_ttr_74_9","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_74","textTraditional":"夏，揚、拒、泉、臯、伊雒之戎同伐京師，入王城，焚東門，王子帶召之也。秦、晉伐戎以救周。秋，晉侯平戎于王。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_ttr_74_10","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_74","textTraditional":"黃人不歸楚貢。冬，楚人伐黃。","sentenceOrder":10}],"overrides":{}}